# Pack scratch trees — _test15/, _tradebuddy_2806/, _mars0809/, _work0806/ ... Each run
# invents a new name and they run to hundreds of MB (1.4 GB sitting here when this was
# added), so blanket-ignore every top-level underscore DIRECTORY. _claude_skills/ is the
# one that is genuinely tracked; anything else new needs `git add -f` on purpose.
/_*/
!/_claude_skills/
